# ─── OSINT Intelligence Platform — Backend environment variables ──────────────
#
# ★ ZERO API KEYS REQUIRED ★
#
# The dashboard is designed to run entirely on public OSINT data. Every
# variable below is OPTIONAL — each one upgrades a single feed, but the
# system runs end-to-end with NONE of them set:
#
#   16 of 24 data sources are fully keyless (OpenSky, USGS, NASA FIRMS,
#   GDELT, OCHA HAPI, Celestrak, NetBlocks, WHO, PeeringDB, ISW/CSIS/RUSI
#   /Bellingcat RSS, etc.). The remaining 8 have working public fallbacks
#   that activate automatically when the key isn't set.
#
# Hit GET /api/sources at runtime for an authoritative inventory of which
# feeds are keyless, which have keys set, and what the fallback is.
#
# Copy to .env if you want to set any optional upgrades:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Server ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Request timeout for upstream API calls (seconds). Default: 30
REQUEST_TIMEOUT=30

# Comma-separated allowed origins for CORS.
# Use * during development. In production set your Netlify URL:
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-site.netlify.app
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*


# ── ACLED (optional — significantly enriches protest geolocation) ─────────────
#
# What it gives you: precise lat/lon for thousands of protest events worldwide.
# Without it, the app uses GDELT (country-level) + HAPI (humanitarian events).
#
# How to get keys (free, ~2 minute signup):
#   1. Go to https://acleddata.com/register/
#   2. Fill in name, email, organisation, intended use
#   3. Receive API key + email in your inbox (usually within minutes)
#   4. Paste them below

ACLED_API_KEY=
ACLED_EMAIL=


# ── N2YO Satellite TLE (optional — enriches satellite tracking) ──────────────
#
# What it gives you: authoritative TLE data for precise satellite positions.
# Without it, the agent falls back to free Celestrak bulk TLE files (still accurate).
#
# How to get a free key (~1 minute):
#   1. Go to https://www.n2yo.com/api/
#   2. Click "Register" and fill in name + email
#   3. Your API key is shown immediately on the dashboard
#   4. Free tier: 1000 API requests/hour
#   NOTE: The agent caches TLEs for 1 hour so only ~32 requests/hour are used.

N2YO_API_KEY=


# ── Cloudflare Radar (optional — enables DDoS attack layer) ──────────────────
#
# What it gives you: real DDoS attack data by country with bandwidth metrics.
# Without it, the DDoS layer falls back to GDELT cyber-attack news.
#
# How to get a free key:
#   1. Go to https://radar.cloudflare.com/
#   2. Sign in with a Cloudflare account (free)
#   3. Generate an API token with Radar:Read permission

CF_RADAR_TOKEN=


# ── Twitter / X API v2 (optional — enables social OSINT feed ticker) ─────────
#
# What it gives you: real-time tweets from verified OSINT accounts
# (e.g. @OSINTdefender, @sentdefender, @IntelCrab).
# Without it, the social ticker shows GDELT/RSS news items only.
#
# How to get Bearer Token:
#   1. Go to https://developer.twitter.com/en/portal/projects-and-apps
#   2. Create a new App (free Basic tier allows 500k tweets/month)
#   3. Copy the "Bearer Token" from the Keys & Tokens tab

TWITTER_BEARER_TOKEN=


# ── NewsAPI (optional — enriches intelligence news feed) ─────────────────────
#
# What it gives you: curated geopolitical & defense headlines from 80,000+ sources.
# Without it, news layer uses GDELT + RSS feeds (free, still works).
#
# How to get a free key:
#   1. Go to https://newsapi.org/register
#   2. Register for a free Developer account (100 requests/day)

NEWS_API_KEY=


# ── No other keys required ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GDELT      — completely free, no registration, no key
# HAPI       — completely free, no registration, no key
# OpenSky    — completely free, anonymous requests allowed (rate limited)
# USGS NEIC  — completely free, no key (earthquake data)
# Celestrak  — completely free, no key (satellite TLE bulk files)
# PeeringDB  — completely free, no key (datacenter/IXP data)
# Leaflet    — completely free, no key
# YouTube    — embed search iframes work without an API key
